# r1m_launch_v8 (prod_1103b, 11-03, USER go: relaunch FRESH) = r1m_launch_v7 + <meshblock> nx2 = nx3 = 32 + <mhd> tracer_strang = true + lhlld_chi_normal = true + <mesh> cs_seam_blockend = extend, and the v7 defaulted keys explicit (keys marked '# v8'; prod_1103b/mkv8.py). Binary: builds_rstfixx/bin/athena_gpu_deep_hot_jupiter_rt_prod_<hash>_fmadoff (prod_1103b/GATES.txt).
# r1m_launch_v7 (prod_1103, 11-03, CANDIDATE, NOT LAUNCHED) = r1m_launch_v6 + <mhd> split_bval_fast = true (tracer_strang ON HOLD 11-03, see r1m_launch_v7_ts.athinput; ck stays the backward-Euler split scheme: no ck_strang / hesdirk2 / 2nd-order cadence keys) (ckbval-1102, fresh default since prod-1102; on r1m a no-op: 0 energy-only refreshes, bitwise). Binary: builds_rstfixx/bin/athena_gpu_deep_hot_jupiter_rt_prod_86346efc_fmadoff (md5 147c0156, prod-1102 86346efc7; prod_1103/GATES.txt). The 5 prod1103 defaults (cb_cont, x1_phi_min 0, rkg_dt_safety 0.8, cs_seam_mhd shared_o, emf_scheme uct_hlld) stay explicit as in v6. Hydro-only ckbval keys (split_c2p_once, c2p_idempotent) have no MHD twin.
# 11-03 USER: v6 EDITED: lhlld_x1_phi_min 1 -> 0, rkg_dt_safety = 0.8 added (old header below is pre-edit; backup .pre_1103)
# r1m_launch_v6 (11-03, PREPARED overnight, NOT LAUNCHED; needs user go) = r1m_launch_v5 keys UNCHANGED. Binary: builds_rstfixx/bin/athena_gpu_deep_hot_jupiter_rt_r1m_0d85a553_fmadoff (md5 28ef5d2d; prod-1102-r1m 0d85a5539 = 523265e40 + r1mspeed-1102, bitwise, 1.23x). lhlld_x1_phi_min stays 1.0 (MHD A/B mhdab_1102: 0 vs 1 same MHD state, 0 adds +10-15 % deep radial 2dx v_r; plain HLLD drains deep KE). rkg_dt_safety NOT changed (0.8 = user decision). On restarts force job/recipe=prod1019 mhd/xe_tracer=true mhd/floor_tracer=true mhd/ambipolar=eos.
# r1m_launch_v5 (11-02) = r1m_launch_v4 + <mhd> cs_seam_mhd = shared_o (USER 11-02; resistive seam EMF cs_seam_res default mean, Ohmic + ambipolar; binary prod-1102-r1m 523265e40). v4 header: (USER: r1m uses the OLD SPLIT ck): = r1m_launch_v3 minus the 2nd-order ck keys (ck_time_scheme hesdirk2, ck_t2_start, ck_t2_seed,
#   ck_cad_probe/drift/cont/cont_len, ck_vef_dt), ck_impl_xstep 0 -> 8 (ck block now identical to w121r1_1101/runs/p1/run.athinput),
#   + <mhd> rkg_fuse_sync = none, + <mhd> cs_seam_mhd = none (TO-DECIDE). Binary: prod-1102-r1m (see prod_1102/R1M_V4_NOTE.txt).
# w121r1_1101 ROUND 1 (user 11-01): WASP-121b at 1x SOLAR, Roche tide ON, fresh start t = 0.  Caltech.  Built by tools/mkdecks.py.
# = viper's docs/handover/w121hfresh_1101/pkg/s10fresh.athinput (md5 7fa4dce6120b64d18438f390aa5d1129, 3x MHD) with ONLY the keys marked '# r1:' changed or added (diff against viper1x/s10fresh.athinput).
# Code: fork/fin51-r-fix c62542349 (= cccfebcb for these decks: c62542349 adds only problem/remap_bfile, read when named); binary in launch.sh.
# Anchor (literature only, as if never run before): roche_anchor.py --mp 1.170 --rp 1.742 --pref 7.07e-4 (1x NRS1 transit pressure)
#   --a_au 0.02571 --porb 1.27492504 --teff 6628 --rstar 1.461 --mstar 1.358 --profile ic_w121_1x_f5.txt --eos <1x EOS dump>
#   -> ap = x1min = 1.144050e10, grav = 1132.4682, roche_a 3.846161e11 (viper; ours 1.144058e10 / 1132.4528 with another 1x dump,
#   7e-6 / 1.4e-5).  Code IC (smoke t = 0): terminator area-equivalent r(7.07e-4 bar) = 1.742 R_J (tools/term_ic_1x.py).
# Grid: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (nx1 112, x1max 2.232001e10, built at x1min = 1.144050e10; min 3.11 cells/H at p >= 1e-6 bar).
# Seam keys: as viper's deck (cs_seam_flux = positive is read as the current default 'shared'); the WASP seam A/B decides.
# Swap-ins (pending): WB tangential tide key, one-way outflow top key: see '# r1 SWAP-IN' lines in <problem> and overrides/README.txt.
# (B) RESISTIVE MHD 10 G: viper's s10_e15 MHD keys kept (lhlld, ohmic_resistivity eos, max_eta 1e15, RKG2 STS, valfven_max_cgs 2e6;
#   lhlld_cb_sensor = 1 and lhlld_emf_eta_pos = true are code defaults since 1b489ce4).  1x keys = viper hfresh_1x's.
#   Angular momentum as the hydro control: <mhd>/am_vector = true + problem/am_transport = false (viper s10 used the pgen am_transport).
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# w121_s10fresh_1027: FRESH START (t = 0) twin of the Raven arm w121_mhd_1003/s10_e15, for Caltech (4 H200),
# production binary fork/fin51-r-fix 6fac5c7ff, PROBLEM deep_hot_jupiter_rt.
# Base = /raven/ptmp/jinma/w121_mhd_1003/inputs/s10_e15.athinput (C32 x nx1 112, x1max 2.1e10, 3x metals,
# 10 G polar dipole at R_p = bbot_gauss 13.594863 at r0, ohmic_resistivity eos, max_eta 1e15, RKG2 STS,
# valfven_max_cgs 2e6, lhlld, ck T4/C2/E4).  Every key is the s10_e15 value except those marked "# s10fresh:":
#   start_time 0, tlim 300 rot (the wall clock / holder end stops it), remap_file removed (fresh IC from
#   ic_profile instead of the remapped 3x hydro state at rot 300), output cadences and last_time/file_number
#   removed, am_hst / am_hst_split added (flux_hst_floor as s10_e15) (diagnostic columns only, no effect on the solution),
#   table paths relative to the run directory (ck/, ic/ from the package).
# IC: ic/ic_w121_3x_f5.txt (face-5 exact RCE, the same IC as the fresh 3x f6 run w121fresh_3x_f6) reaches
#   1e-10 bar; above it the pgen column (get_init_eos_arr, N = 10000 to 1.1 (x1max - x1min)) is isothermal at
#   the top row (3726 K) in point-mass gravity, so the raised top up to 2.1e10 is filled by the pgen itself.
# B: set at t = 0 by the pgen (fresh-start branch, !restart): A_phi dipole, B_r = bbot cos(theta) (r0/r)^3,
#   bbot from problem/bbot_gauss (pgen.cpp ReadHotJupiterBbot; bbot and bbot_gauss together are FATAL).
#------------------------- PAR_DUMP -------------------------
<comment>
problem   = ultra-hot Jupiter, general EOS + metal ionization, PURE HYDRO (hyd4)  
reference = Heng et al. MNRAS 413, 2380 (2011); Perna et al. ApJ 719, 1421 (2010) 
<job>
basename = dhj 
<mesh>
cs_seam_blockend           = extend   # v8: layoutbug-1103 fresh default; no-op with one MeshBlock per panel (explicit)
cs_seam_fc_nolimit         = true   # v8: explicit (was the fresh cs MHD default in v7)
nghost                    = 2            
nx1                  = 112   # s10_e15 grid (remap target)
x1min                 = 1.144050e+10   # r1: Roche anchor 1x (viper gate/roche_anchor_1x.txt; ours anchor/anchor_out.txt 1.144058e10 / 1132.4528 with eos_1x.txt); viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
x1max                 = 2.232001e+10   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
ix1_bc                    = user         
ox1_bc                    = user         
nx2                       = 32           
x2min                     = -1.0         # -1 lets the pgen set the full polar range
x2max                     = 1.0          
ix2_bc                    = panel        
ox2_bc                    = panel        
nx3                       = 32           
x3min                     = -1.0         
x3max                     = 1.0          
ix3_bc                    = panel        
ox3_bc                    = panel        
use_grid_stretch_r_poly   = true         
f_stretch_r_c1        = -1.597547   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_c2        = -1.578371   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_c3        = -12.073881   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_c4        = 74.674546   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_c5        = -273.067922   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_c6        = 535.436451   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_c7        = -482.162508   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_c8        = 159.458581   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
use_cubed_sphere          = true         
cs_seam_flux              = shared       # user 11-01: pinned (seam A/B: positive_donor == shared)
cs_seam_resample          = linear       # w121prod_0927: convex seam ghost resample (default; explicit)
cs_seam_rho_guard         = 4            # w121prod_0927: seam ghost density guard (default; explicit)
f_stretch_r_b1_amp    = -1.471727   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_b1_x      = 0.533072   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_b1_w      = 0.155245   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_b2_amp    = -2.437299   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_b2_x      = 0.692302   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
f_stretch_r_b2_w      = 0.102815   # r1: viper grid/gridkeys_112_roche.txt (grid112 at the Roche anchor, max dr/target 1.058)
<meshblock>
nx1                  = 112   # s10_e15 grid (remap target)
nx2                  = 32   # v8 (USER 11-03): one MeshBlock per panel (6 MeshBlocks, no seam block ends, 6.7 % faster; v7: 16)
nx3                  = 32   # v8 (USER 11-03): one MeshBlock per panel (6 MeshBlocks, no seam block ends, 6.7 % faster; v7: 16)
<time>
dt_retry                   = true   # v8: explicit (the v7 default; dhj has no rad_m1: the code switches it off, not wired)
start_time           = 0.0   # s10fresh: fresh start (s10_e15: 33046050.0, t of the remapped dhj.00600.rst)
evolution             = dynamic      
integrator            = rk2          
cfl_number            = 0.3          
nlim                  = 1000000000   # effectively no cycle limit; tlim and the wall clock stop it.
tlim                  = 1.0e9   # r1: very long, the chain is stopped by hand (user rule 10-14; viper 3.304605e+07 = 300 rot)
ndiag                 = 100          
dt_min                = 1.0e-3       # as s10_e15
<units>
length_cgs = 1.0 
mass_cgs   = 1.0 
time_cgs   = 1.0 
mu         = 1.0 
<mhd>
tracer_strang              = true   # v8 (USER 11-03): tracer advance Strang-split (trcrst-1103 restart-bitwise)
lhlld_chi_normal           = true   # v8 (USER 11-03 "use u_n for lhllc/d"): LHLLD c_u from the face-normal velocity (prod1103 fresh default)
am_transport               = true   # v8: explicit (was the cs default in v7)
valfven_noinfall_fac       = 4   # v8: explicit (was the default with valfven_max_cgs > 0 in v7)
floor_tracer               = true   # v8: explicit (was the default with valfven_max_cgs > 0 in v7)
xe_tracer                  = true   # v8: explicit (was the default with ohmic/ambipolar eos in v7)
ambipolar                  = eos   # v8: explicit (was the default in v7)
rkg_lean                   = true   # v8: explicit (was the default on a uniform cubed sphere in v7)
split_bval_fast            = true   # prod_1103 v7: ckbval-1102 energy-only split refresh (fresh default; r1m: no-op, bitwise)
emf_scheme = uct_hlld   # ucthlld-1102: UCT-HLLD corner EMF (replaces emf_smooth)
cs_seam_mhd                = shared_o   # r1m v5 USER 11-02 (ucthshare-1102): shared seam-edge / cube-vertex UCT EMF from each panel's own-grid contributions; cs_seam_res default mean
lhlld_cb_cont              = true  # USER 11-01: continuous odd-even sensor weight (cbcont-1102 34ec05e93; the default clamp(J/d2) jump makes RK2 first order; deep u,v error 62x smaller in hydro). Needs a binary with cbcont (the prod branch).
rkg_strang                 = true   # prod-1102 (USER 11-02): RKG super-step Strang-split around the RK stages (rkgstrang-1102)
rkg_strang_fuse            = true   # prod-1102 (USER 11-02): fused Strang RKG across cycles, synced at outputs (rkgfuse-1102)
rkg_fuse_sync              = none   # r1m v4 (ckdrift-1102): carried RKG half stays across outputs (fuse result independent of the output cadence; gated)
lhlld_x1_phi_min           = 0.0   # USER 11-03: low-Mach on radial faces too (mhdab_1102 M2 = M1 within 0.5-2 %, +10-15 % deep radial 2dx v_r, flat)
rkg_dt_safety              = 0.8   # USER 11-03: RKG super-step safety 0.5 -> 0.8 (r1mspeed_1102: tracks 0.5 to 1e-4, edge ~1.3; 1.33x total)
wellbalance_dynamic        = true                   
wb_x1                      = true                   
wb_option                  = polytropic             
wb_cache_every             = 0                      
cs_wellbalanced_src        = false                  # 09-23 user: DROPPED. min beta at prod3 rot 283 = 1.22 (>> the ~2e-3 crossover); hurts hydro accuracy (tests_hyd4/README_wbsrc.md)
isotropic_conduction       = none                   # 09-25 ROUTE B: ck two-stream to the wall, no diffusion (rad_* below unused)
rad_implicit_x1            = true                   
rad_cap_ang                = 0.5                    # silent no-op with rad_angular=false below; kept for the diff.
rad_angular                = false                  # CHANGED from prod3 (implicit default true): see change (3).
rad_tau_lo                 = 30.0                   
rad_tau_hi                 = 300.0                  
rad_kappa_src              = table                  
rad_flux_inner             = -1.0                   # unused under route B (no conduction); sigma T_int^4 enters at the ck bottom (problem/ck_int_at_cut)
rad_met               = 0.0   # r1: 1x (as viper hfresh_1x)
eos                        = general                
general_eos                = table                  
reconstruct                = plm                    
rsolver                    = lhlld   # w121_mhd_1003: MHD rsolver for dhj (user 09-29)
am_vector                  = true    # r1: as the hydro control (A); AmModule is shared by <hydro> and <mhd>; viper s10 used the pgen am_transport (no am_* key)
gamma                      = 1.4727545958           # unused by the table; kept so ideal/general inputs match
etotgrav                   = true                   
eos_h2                     = true                   # H2 dissociation: the heat pipe
eos_ionization             = true                   # Saha for H, He, He+
eos_metal_ionization       = true                   # Na, K, Ca, Al, Mg, Fe -- the electron donors
eos_radiation              = false                  # aT^4/3 is ~1e-7 of the gas pressure here
eos_xh                = 0.7381   # r1: 1x solar (as viper hfresh_1x)
eos_yhe               = 0.2485   # r1: 1x solar (as viper hfresh_1x)
eos_metal_condensation     = true                   
eos_logd_min               = -19.0   # w121_mhd_1003: as the C128 production (user 10-03)
eos_logd_max               = 0.0                    
eos_logt_min               = 1.5                    
eos_logt_max               = 6.0                    
eos_dlog                   = 0.05                   
pfloor               = 1.0e-7   # s10_e15 value (fresh 3x f6: pfloor 1e-5, dfloor 1e-16; raised top needs these)
dfloor               = 1.0e-18   # s10_e15 value (fresh 3x f6: pfloor 1e-5, dfloor 1e-16; raised top needs these)
tfloor_kelvin              = 200.0                  
ohmic_resistivity          = eos   # w121_mhd_1003: thermal ionisation (Saha H/He + Na K Ca Al Mg Fe), eta = 230 sqrt(T)/x_e + Spitzer
max_eta                    = 1.000e+15   # w121_mhd_1003: cap [cm^2/s] (user 10-03: test 1e13/1e14/1e15)
use_rkg_sts                = true   # w121_mhd_1003: RKG2 super-time-stepping (user 10-03 STS test; operator split after the RK2 step, rkg_lean off)
valfven_max_cgs            = 2.000e+06   # w121_mhd_1003: Alfven-speed density floor [cm/s] (branch mhd-va-floor); acts only at p < 1e-6 bar on the 3x state

<problem>
sponge_top            = true                                                                    # w121prod_0927: top velocity sponge ON (1e-7..1e-6 bar) (was true)
roche_wb_tan          = true       # MHD WB tide merged fin51-r-fix dd781f22 (11-01)
relax_drag            = false      # USER 11-01: no start-up Rayleigh drag (relaxdrag test, fin51-r-fix d3f878be)
top_bc                = outflow1   # USER 11-01: uniform one-way outflow top for all planets (hydro_prep_1101 verdict)
sponge_bottom         = false                                                                   # w121prod_0927: user 09-27: NO bottom sponge (was true)
flux_hst_floor        = true                                                                    # w121prod_0929: Efloor, Efloor_rt, Mfloor hst columns
# flux_hst_wall NOT set: s10fresh smoke 12405109 FATAL "am_hst ... at most 24 user history columns (have 27)"; 9 flux + 3 floor + 11 am_hst_split = 23
am_hst                = true    # s10fresh: angular momentum columns Lrel Iw Tcor Tcc Tcont Tbnd (diagnostic only)
am_hst_split          = false    # s10fresh: + Tx1 Tx2 Tx3 Tsrc Tcons in place of Tdif_deep Tdif_rad (diagnostic only)   # 11-01: Ttide column + flux_hst_floor -> >24 hst columns (viper note bf54375e)
am_transport          = false   # r1: REQUIRED with <mhd>/am_vector (pgen YieldToPgen FATAL otherwise), as the hydro control
ck_implicit           = true                                                                    # w121prod_0927: T4 (was false)
ck_impl_arat          = 1e30                                                                    # w121prod_0927: T4 (was 2.0)
ck_impl_frozen_op     = true                                                                    # w121prod_0927: T4 (was false)
ck_impl_frozen_cof    = true                                                                    
ck_impl_lin           = true                                                                    # w121prod_0927: T4 (was false)
ck_impl_lin_thr       = 1                                                                       # w121prod_0927: T4 (was 1)
ck_impl_fuse          = true                                                                    # w121prod_0927: T4 (was false)
ck_impl_jac_lin       = true                                                                    # w121prod_0927: T4 (was false)
ck_impl_cvsec         = true                                                                    # w121prod_0927: T4 (was false)
ck_impl_tol           = 1.0e-8                                                                  # 3x-ck10: kept at the 3x value (user 09-30: only the keys that may remove the inflow)
ck_impl_dtol          = 1.0e-8                                                                  
ck_impl_maxit         = 16                                                                      # reset 09-30 (user): original 3x key (Caltech A/B: no limit cycle with 3x keys)
ck_impl_dtmax         = 0.5                                                                     # reset 09-30 (user): original 3x key (Caltech A/B)
ck_impl_demax         = 0.5                                                                     # default: bound on the total |e - e*|/e* per call (0 = off; off + dtmax 3 collapsed dt, SMOKE_DIAG.md)
ck_impl_floorbound    = true                                                                    # 1x SOLAR (x1/README): was true in the 10x input
ck_impl_kkt_demax     = true                                                                    # 1x SOLAR (x1/README): was true in the 10x input
ck_impl_kkt_row       = true                                                                    # w121prod_0927: default since 7df65ad2; explicit (was true)
ck_impl_conserve      = 2                                                                       # user 10-28: 2 = reported ck fluxes consistent with the applied energy in EVERY cell (was 1: bound cells only); solution bitwise unchanged
ck_impl_verbose       = false                                                                   
ck_impl_debug         = 0                                                                       
ck_impl_once          = true                                                                    # w121prod_0927: C2 (was false)
ck_impl_warm          = false                                                                   
ck_impl_reuse_jac     = 0                                                                       
ck_impl_seed          = 0                                                                       
ck_impl_lw            = false                                                                   
ck_impl_xstep         = 8   # r1m v4 (USER 11-02: old split ck): as the hydro W121 r1 p1 deck (w121prod_0927: C2, 09-26: 8)
ck_impl_xstep_thr     = 0.0                                                                     
ck_impl_jreuse        = 0.2                                                                     # w121prod_0927: C2 (was 0.0)
ck_impl_pred          = true                                                                    # w121prod_0927: C2 (was false)
ck_impl_pred_fac      = 0.5                                                                     # w121prod_0927: C2 (was 1.0)
ck_impl_pred_chk      = false                                                                   
ck_impl_jreuse_xc     = false                                                                   
ck_impl_warm_step     = false                                                                   
ck_impl_cvkeep        = false                                                                   
ck_impl_every         = 4                                                                       # w121prod_0927: E4 (was 1)
ck_impl_every_thr     = 0.0                                                                     
ck_impl_jreuse_act    = 0.25                                                                    
ck_impl_nosync        = true                                                                    # w121prod_0927: C2 (was false)
user_srcs             = true                                                                    
hot_jupiter           = true                                                                    
Teq                   = 2409.3                                                                  # WASP-121b: Teff sqrt(R*/2a), Sing+2024 (zero albedo, full redistribution; = their 2409 +- 24 K) (was 2500.0)
omega                 = 5.704026e-05                                                            # WASP-121b: 2 pi / P_orb, P = 1.27492504 d (Bourrier+2020, adopted by Sing+2024); tidally locked (was 2.06e-5)
rot_potential         = true                                                                    # sp_mhd_prod3 value; see change (2) header note for the
grav                  = 1132.4682   # r1: Roche anchor 1x (viper gate/roche_anchor_1x.txt; ours anchor/anchor_out.txt 1.144058e10 / 1132.4528 with eos_1x.txt); G M_p = grav ap^2 = 1.482232e23 unchanged
grav_point_mass       = true                                                                    
ap                    = 1.144050e+10   # r1: Roche anchor 1x (viper gate/roche_anchor_1x.txt; ours anchor/anchor_out.txt 1.144058e10 / 1132.4528 with eos_1x.txt) = x1min
roche                 = true   # r1: host-star Roche tide (roche-dhj-1031); G M_* from Kepler (M_* 1.3938, lit. 1.358)
roche_a               = 3.846161e+11   # r1: a = 0.02571 AU
ic_adiabat_ext        = true   # r1: default; T below the IC table along the adiabat (wall reaches 4680 bar substellar)
ic_adiabat_ext_dex    = 2.0   # r1: default; the wall needs 0.32 dex below the table
# r1 SWAP-IN (pending, not in binary cccfebcb): well-balanced tangential tide key, e.g.  roche_wb_tan = true  (name TBD;
#   needs a new binary: launch with BIN= and OVR=, overrides/README.txt)
# r1 SWAP-IN (pending user approval): one-way outflow top key (name TBD; same mechanism)
Rgas                  = 4.593e7                                                                 # ignored under the general EOS; composition is the EOS's
met                   = 0.0   # r1: 1x (as viper hfresh_1x)
rt_de_max             = 0.5                                                                     
rt_use_cons           = true                                                                    
rt_ck                 = true                                                                    
rt_split              = false                                                                   
ck_pcut_bar           = 1e8                                                                     # 09-25 ROUTE B: the cut falls on the inner wall
ck_nquad              = 2                                                                       # 09-25: exact non-grey diffusion limit (nq2_0925)
ck_int_at_cut         = true                                                                    # route B: sigma T_int^4 enters ONCE, as the ck intensity at the wall
ck_star_teff          = 0.0                                                                     # WASP-121b: <= 0: stellar band fluxes from ck_swflux (WASP-121 model spectrum), not a blackbody (was 6000.0)
